{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"Ferrytown","id":"852771728043802654","name":"gamebooth-arcadian-idol🎶🎤","position":96,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":"charisma-based gamebooth on Illo'fae.  Open mic stage, impress the judges, one try per day (Charisma check)\nThree judges sit before a stage. \nShitake Scowl, a Puffkin who rarely looks happy.\nHowie Hardback, a Tortle who never touches anyone.\nPoppy Shores-a bubbly Seelie Fey.","type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852771728043802654","content":"This booth is a stage full of lights with three judges (a Puffkin, a Tortle, and a Seelie Fey) in front of the stage on their own platform, looking bored.\n\n**Step right up and take your place amongst Empire City’s best entertainers! (Make a Charisma check, no modifier) Also RP your performance.\n\n1 try per day. Limit one of each prize per player.**\n\n\n**If 14 or lower:** The judges lean in to deliberate. After a few moments they turn back to you. “I’m sorry,” says Poppy “Unfortunately we have decided that your performance today wasn’t enough for a prize. Come back another day and try again! I’m sure you’ll get there!” \n\n**DC 15**- Fannypack of Glamour\nIf won, post: The three judges all lean in to deliberate amongst themselves. Poppy walks up to you and hands you a shiny small bag with a very short strap. It has rainbow sequins all over it. “Congrats you won the fanny pack of glamour! You wear it around your hips!” This bag holds “things” and its really pretty. \n\n**DC 19**- Wand of Smiles\nIf won, post: Poppy hands you a wooden wand with what looks like teeth inlayed into it. “Wonderful work up there! Here’s a wand that’ll make anyone you point it at smile for a whole minute! But you can only use it thrice daily. Enjoy!” \n\n**DC 23**- Instrument of Illusions\nIf won, post: Poppy steps up to you and points to three instruments on the side of the stage. “Pick one!” (Choose whatever instrument you want it to be) “You sure deserve it for that performance!”  (While you are playing this musical instrument, you can create harmless, illusory visual effects within a 5-foot-radius sphere centered on the instrument. If you are a bard, the radius increases to 15 feet. Sample visual effects include luminous musical notes, a spectral dancer, butterflies, and gently falling snow.)","created_at":"2021-06-11T04:54:11.826000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T16:22:32.003000Z","id":"852772684881723422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
