{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852771728043802654","content":"Seraxa gets up on the stage and starts reciting the intro to A:TLA.\n\"Water.\" She casts Shape Water and animates the water to swirl around her. \n\"Earth.\" Nothing happens. She does not have any earth-related magic.\n\"Fire.\" She casts Control Flames, and makes any fires and candles in the area become brighter.\n\"Air.\" She finally casts Gust, and causes the clothes and hair of the judges to ripple.\n\nShe bows. She didn't memorize the whole speech. Just those four words.","created_at":"2021-07-11T03:48:24.679000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T03:51:17.038000Z","id":"863627765316059186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
